OL,3,GNEWSAGas works to disrupt 'lifeline'
OL,4,Abus service
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in part of Peterborough have
OL,7,Fraised concerns about changes to a bus
OL,8,Fservice during planned gas works.
OL,10,FBus operator Stagecoach said its Number
OL,11,F3 service, which serves parts of
OL,12,FBretton, will not stop at Bretton
OL,13,FCentre between 1 September and 25
OL,14,FOctober while Cadent Gas carries out
OL,15,Fpipe replacement works in the area.
OL,17,FDuring the disruption, the nearest stop
OL,18,Ffor passengers will be Eyescroft,
OL,19,FDearleap or Peterborough City Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
